{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Stand!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Bow!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Good morniiing!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yes, good morning."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Right, so our homeroom teacher is </STYLE><STYLE ID="14" RUBY="むかい">Mukai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">-sensei.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Only now is it really sinking in that I'm a second-year.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Even so, it really was hot today...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Partly because we'd stayed at Zahha till the last minute and rushed to school, though.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">When I rolled up my sleeve a little, my bandaged left arm appeared.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">It was the cut I had made myself, back then.</STYLE>
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "300" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Oh, </STYLE>Kogori-san<STYLE ID="3">, back from today, I see. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">How was the memorial service?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh?
{PAUSE ""}
　Yes, well, it was hard in a lot of ways."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Hard doesn't even begin to cover it...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">When I looked around, the classmates were all the same, and the homeroom teacher was Mukai-sensei.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">It's probably going to be a laid-back year.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">My seat's at the very back, and the seat next to me is empty, so I should be able to take it easy.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Ah, but there'll be a seat change sooner or later...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">This seat at the very back is pretty precious...</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Also, it's sudden, but today I'll introduce a transfer student."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "環境音\教室.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE2" "800" "500" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3">At those words from Mukai-sensei, the classroom started buzzing.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">A transfer student, at this time of year?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">A week earlier, and the transfer student could have </STYLE><STYLE ID="15" RUBY="なじ">fit in</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> naturally.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sliding_wooden_door_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">The classroom door opened, and the transfer student came in.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Ooh...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Whoa...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">At the sight of the transfer student, the class stirred even more.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Long, silky hair, slender legs, beautiful features―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">the word 'sparkle' practically floated in the air around her.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">And what struck me most of all was―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\キーン.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">her face.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\なつみの教室.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "T" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\フィオ\フィオ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="11">Itohime</STYLE>...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\その女、闇より出る的なBGM.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">That face was familiar.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Her features were the spitting image of </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">And she was the girl who'd been talking with </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> this morning!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Stopping by the place where that goshinboku had been, this morning...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Don't tell me she was really reborn―</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="11">"(Osakan dialect) How do you do, y'all. I'm </STYLE><STYLE ID="17" RUBY="いおり">Iori </STYLE><STYLE ID="16" RUBY="ごしらかわ">Goshirakawa</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">Um... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">Born and raised in Osaka, but on account of one thing and another, I've moved out this way. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">Oh, and about my transfer bein' late... </STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Then </STYLE><STYLE ID="16" RUBY="ごしらかわ">Goshirakawa</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> stopped short.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">For a moment, tension ran through the classroom.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\フィオ\フィオ腰に手.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="18">"My transfer was late 'cause I bunny-hopped the whole 500 kilometers from Osaka!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">　Lordy, that plumb wore me out... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">Hop, hop!"</STYLE><PG>
