{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPS>Swallowing my shame, I shouted at the top of my lungs.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The whole class snapped around to look at me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Mukai-sensei looked at me too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Everyone looked at me with eyes that said, "What is </STYLE>this girl<STYLE ID="3"> going on about?"</STYLE>
