{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPN>Then </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Goshirakawa-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s face lit right up.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\フィオ\フィオ腰に手.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\日々と泉.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="11">"Ooh! See there, Osaka humor gets through anywhere after all!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">　Sensei, that seat next to </STYLE>her<STYLE ID="11">, it's free, ain't it!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Ah, yes, go ahead... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Um, the question time and so on―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Before the teacher could finish, </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Goshirakawa-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> came running over to me.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\フィオ\フィオ腰に手バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="11">"Mighty pleased to meet you! </STYLE><STYLE ID="17" RUBY="いおり">Iori </STYLE><STYLE ID="16" RUBY="ごしらかわ">Goshirakawa</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">　Well, thank goodness! A tad late, but you sure put some holler into it, nice comeback!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">Goshirakawa-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> looked at me with sparkling eyes.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">So she really was waiting for a comeback...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Oh... I'm Natsumi Kogori. 
{PAUSE ""}
Um... nice to meet you."<PG>
<STYLE ID="11">"Ko-go-ri...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">　Aha! Now that's an unusual family name if I ever heard one!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">　Course, mine's unusual too! Anyhow, you be good to me now, hear?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\フィオ\フィオバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="11">Goshirakawa-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> held out her left hand to me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">A beat behind, I held out my hand too, and we shook hands.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Taking my hand, </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Goshirakawa-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> squeezed it tight.</STYLE><PG>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
"Ah, ow...!"
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">"Huh!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">　S-sorry! Was I squeezin' too hard!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"No, it's just that I've got a little injury..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">It had jarred the cut I'd made on my arm with the knife.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Then </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Goshirakawa-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> gently stroked my bandaged left arm.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="11">"Looks like this hand's been through somethin' awful. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">It's all right, now. It'll heal up real soon."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"O-okay..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">The tender look and voice she suddenly showed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">That, too, was so very like </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Everyone was watching our exchange with puzzled looks.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">W-well, everyone in Motoki-cho is nice, so even someone like </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Goshirakawa-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> will surely fit in.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Probably... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Surely... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Most likely... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Nine times out of ten... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Maybe.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="11">"</STYLE>Kogori-san<STYLE ID="11">, thank you kindly. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">I reckoned I'd gone and blown it with that bit, but you read the room for me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Kogori-san<STYLE ID="11">, you're real good people."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">Goshirakawa-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> gave me a smile.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">When I saw that smile, I felt my heart drawn right in.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">A comfortable gaze that somehow made me feel so warm, and happy too.</STYLE><PG>
"Hey, are <STYLE ID="11">you</STYLE> by any chance..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">"Hmm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE>Kogori-san<STYLE ID="3">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Goshirakawa-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, it's fine to get excited on first meeting, but please settle down now."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">"Ah, sorry 'bout that, Sensei!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">　Well then, see you later on, hear?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<STYLE ID="11">Goshirakawa-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> took her seat as if nothing had happened.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Right, I'll take attendance."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Even as Mukai-sensei said it, not only the boys but the girls too kept looking at </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Goshirakawa-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, their eyes </STYLE><STYLE ID="20" RUBY="くぎ">glued</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Well, with someone this beautiful it couldn't be helped, but I was staring at her for a different reason.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="11">Iori Goshirakawa</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Is this girl really </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Itohime</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s reincarnation?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">If she is...</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPD TIME="4294967246">If she is, then I have to welcome </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">this girl</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> with everything I've got.</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\Any_time.ogg" "BGM" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">No, even if she isn't a reincarnation, I have to show her what a good place Motoki-cho is.</STYLE>
{WAIT "2000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">It looks like </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">this girl</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and I are going to know each other for a long time.</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{MESOFF "1000"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{CREATECG "111" "$FFFFFF" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,000" "12" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
